   "text": "Eynesbury College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nEynesbury College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nEynesbury offers the most comprehensive range of pathway programs in South Australia, which provides maximum flexibility in assisting students to gain entry to their chosen degree pathway and in preparing them for academic success at university. As a leading pathway provider for almost 30 years, they have successfully prepared thousands of students for university in Australia. Foundation Studies students have direct entry into The University of Adelaide, University of South Australia, or any other university in Australia. CRICOS Provider Code: 00561M.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 05:53\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:02\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$34,009.00\nMin: A$23,179.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n9%\n650 of 7,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1989\nCampus(es)\nAdelaide\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ezp3EOu1RpQ\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
